WEBVTT

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:20.880
The Cauldron of Resonance
has come alive!

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:23.880
The Gate of Time will open!

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:30.520
Ai!

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:36.420
Asagi!

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:39.930
You do not have the mark!
You can go to the world outside!

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:42.500
You can leave this place!

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:45.900
But what about everyone else?

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.100
lt's impossible. . .

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:49.240
We cannot leave this place.

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:52.910
Don't worry about us.

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.440
Hurry and go!

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:58.550
No! l don't want to go!
l don't want to leave you!

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.020
No! You alone must go!

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:06.950
Sister. . .!

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.730
Good-bye, Ai. . .

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.870
One seems to have escaped.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:54.570
What a pain in the neck!

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.640
Gora, get her back!

00:03:50.190 --> 00:03:51.960
Heh, there's a stench in the air!

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:11.780
You've come to.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.380
Are you all right?

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:14.020
Uh-huh!

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:15.380
Sango!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:17.150
Hang on tight!

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:21.390
Kirara, let's leave this place!

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.140
What is that?

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:42.080
lt's coming this way!

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:46.350
Kagome!

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:48.380
Miroku! Sango!

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.260
Kagome, please take this child.

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:53.220
All right!

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:54.790
Shippo, let's go!

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:55.590
Gotcha!

00:04:59.060 --> 00:04:59.830
Take care of her.

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:00.800
You got it!

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:01.930
Sango!

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:02.700
Let's go!

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:05.470
You're safe now.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:11.770
A demon?

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:13.770
Look at its size!

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:25.920
lnuyasha!

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.190
lt's lnuyasha!

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:34.140
Huh?

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:39.970
Don't mess with me!

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:51.810
FlRE ON THE MYSTlC lSLAND

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:11.210
A turtle?!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.140
lNUYASHA
A half-demon whose seal was
broken by Kagome

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.770
Over here, turtle!

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:28.080
lnuyasha!

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:31.820
Dammit!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:40.900
Hiraikotsu!

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:43.730
lt didn't work!

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.400
Kagome!

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:53.520
Worry about me, too!

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:55.110
Kagome!

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:58.550
What're you doing?!

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.180
But. . .

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:00.110
How come no one saves me?!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:04.050
SHIPPO
A child-fox who uses fox magic.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.090
l don't wanna die!

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:09.690
We wouldn't abandon you.

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.160
l was so scared!

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:13.860
You're safe now.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:15.500
Well. . .

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.100
MlROKU
A monk with a Wind Tunnel
in his right palm

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.730
maybe not quite yet.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:19.900
SANGO
Lone Survivor of
a tribe of Demon Slayers

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.700
it seems so.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:23.100
What'll we do?

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:24.120
Huh?!

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.340
Oh. . .this feels wonderful.
lt eases my anxiety.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.750
What do you think you're doing?!

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:34.620
Forgive me.

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:41.020
Miroku!

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:42.360
Transform!

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:47.760
You saved me!

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:49.730
You're an albatross, huh, Shippo?

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:50.600
A hawk!

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.610
Wind Tunnel!

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:03.780
lt's no good, Miroku!
You're only sucking in seawater!

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:06.710
Miroku!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:08.020
Miroku, Sango!
Get outta the way!

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.330
Wind. . .Scar!

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:19.860
Stupid!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.400
lt's not over yet, lnuyasha!

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:22.310
What?!

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:26.530
Damn! lt's tougher than l thought!

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:27.370
KAGOME
A girl who traveled through
time into the feudal era

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:30.940
Its body is so hard!
Does it have a weakness?

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.220
lnuyasha!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:39.680
Try it one more time!

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:40.750
Uh. . .right.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.500
Go!

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:00.400
Get a taste of my. . .

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:03.200
Wind Scar!

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:29.100
Gora has been defeated.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:31.930
Why that bastard!

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:34.200
He killed my dear little brother. . .

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:37.140
They called that half-demon
lnuyasha.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:40.240
What shall we do, Ryura?

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:42.110
This time. . .

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:45.750
he won't escape off this island!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:56.600
Hey, lnuyasha!
Kagome!

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:58.460
ls everyone okay?

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:01.460
Say, lnuyasha. . .
Who is that child?

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:02.410
Huh?

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:04.170
Oh. . .

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.130
l was shocked when
l first saw her, too.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.540
lnuyasha!

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.580
lt's been fifty years
since l last saw her.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:12.320
What?

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:17.650
lnuyasha!

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:18.980
This child. . .

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:20.680
Oh, that child is. . .

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:22.850
She's a half-demon.

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:24.190
No kidding.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.290
Quit hugging me!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.470
lnuyasha. . .

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:34.960
Please save everyone!

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:35.960
Huh?

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:49.650
Here you are, Ai.

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:57.380
lt's yummy!

00:10:57.850 --> 00:10:58.930
Thank you!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.430
So then, where did you run away from?

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:06.290
Horai lsland. . .

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:08.330
The island beyond this ocean.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:12.810
l was looking down from the sky,
but l didn't see any island.

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:14.680
The mist was heavy.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:19.520
Horai lsland is the island
from the legends.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:20.110
Huh?

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:24.560
lt's an island which appears
once every few decades

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.880
along with the mist.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.550
FlFTY YEARS AGO

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:29.560
This was before...
FlFTY YEARS AGO

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:31.150
This was before...

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:33.260
Kikyo put me under seal.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.360
Which way is land!
Dammit!

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:42.730
Well, look at this fog.

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.430
Don't get so upset.

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.030
Uh-huh. . .

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:48.070
What's that?

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:50.470
An island?

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:04.250
Huh?

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:09.700
We found half-demon kids
just like this one.

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:12.570
According to their story,

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:17.440
they were slaves to demons
known as the Four War Gods.

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:20.310
Just who are you?!

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:21.850
Wait, lnuyasha!

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:29.720
lnuyasha. . .

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:30.520
Huh?

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:32.250
Let's hear what they have to say.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:33.950
Man! What a bother!

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:37.900
You kids, run!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:43.660
Kikyo!

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:44.870
lnuyasha!

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.340
lron-Reaver, Soul-Stealer!

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.710
Blades of Blood!

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.120
This thing. . .is sucking my blood!

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:13.860
Kikyo!

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:29.980
Who are you?!

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:32.040
Half-demons like you. . .

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.520
shouldn't get wise!

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:38.860
lnuyasha!

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:40.820
Are you all right?

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:42.930
Why you-!

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:46.230
We the Four War Gods. . .

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:49.600
will eventually claim your lives!

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:53.430
Dammit!

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:57.840
lnuyasha!

00:13:58.800 --> 00:13:59.810
l let him get away!

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:03.310
Are you okay, Kikyo?

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.370
Yes, but we were careless.

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:07.920
lnuyasha! The island!

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:09.080
Huh?

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.620
What the-?!

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:16.520
We couldn't do a thing
since it disappeared.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.700
So we returned to the village.

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.330
Later, Kikyo told me that

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:26.270
it was Horai lsland
of the legends.

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:34.680
l once heard that the first
emperor of the Chin Dynasty

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:37.800
searched for Horai lsland in
his quest for eternal youth.

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:42.890
So that's why Ai hasn't changed
since 50 years ago.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.890
Brothers. . . Sisters. . .

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:52.000
lnuyasha!

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:52.930
What's wrong?

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:58.640
lt's nothing.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:01.670
Did you hurt your back?
Let me see.

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.970
Shaddup! l said it's nothing!

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.580
There is something!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.370
- Let me see!
- You two!

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.510
- Quit touching me!
-You'll wake Ai with your shouting.

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:12.280
Sit, boy!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:19.890
So, this is the mark
of the Four War Gods?

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:22.330
l'm gonna get you for this!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.940
l thought l smelled something
in the wind.

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:40.470
No wonder. . .

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:47.050
That's Horai lsland, isn't it?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.020
Wha-? You didn't turn in?

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:52.390
So now what, lnuyasha?

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:54.590
Will you go to rescue
the children?

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:57.290
Hah! Not likely.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:01.630
But l'm gonna make 'em
pay for the scar on my back.

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:03.870
Then it's decided.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:12.610
An island!
You can see an island!

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:14.080
What is it?

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:15.750
Hey, it's an island!

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.510
Huh? That's. . .

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:22.890
the one that appeared fifty years ago,
the same time as the demons. . .

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.060
That's the lsland of Demons!

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:27.920
lt is very frightening.

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:31.490
Fifty years ago, the lsland of Demons
appeared

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:38.740
and many of the villagers were killed
by the demons that came.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:44.270
Women or children. . .
lt matters not to the demons.

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:48.080
Running away is useless.

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:51.580
You cannot escape
from those demons.

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.380
Thank you for the tea.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.250
Where are you going, Priestess?

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.020
l shall end it.

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.220
Huh?

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:08.970
Oh, the resounding bell
of the Gion temple. . .

00:17:11.690 --> 00:17:13.340
The salt air irritates
my throat.

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:18.440
Lord Sesshomaru. . .

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.680
lf we keep going,
we'll end up on the beach.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.780
He's not listening at all.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:31.150
Jaken, just follow Lord Sesshomaru
and we'll be fine!

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:33.820
Oh be quiet
and mind your own business!

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:37.060
No one knows Lord Sesshomaru
better than me. . .!

00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:38.100
Oww!

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.470
Please forgive me, Lord Sesshomaru!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.470
lt's only because Rin here
made a silly comment and. . .

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:45.540
So it has appeared.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:46.700
Huh?

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:50.140
What appeared, Lord Sesshomaru?

00:17:58.070 --> 00:17:59.450
l can see it.

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:02.350
That's Horai lsland?

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:03.690
What is it?

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:06.020
l sense something evil
from that island.

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:08.390
Be extra careful.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:14.700
Heh-heh! Here they come!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:20.300
And they're bringing the runaway half-demon.
How kind of them.

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:21.640
Jura!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:22.470
Huh?

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:25.640
Shall we warm up?

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:28.710
Sounds good.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:30.580
Well then, Brother. . .

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:32.850
l'll handle the other visitor.

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.000
Please spare us. . .!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.330
Please answer our prayers!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.340
Have mercy on us!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.640
l am Kyora of the Four War Gods.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:04.780
This is a sacred site
which will become a battlefield.

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:09.950
Hence, your presence is
a hindrance.

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:23.330
Birds of Fire!

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:54.100
So you've come.

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:59.100
l've waited a long time
for this moment. . .

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:01.170
Sesshomaru.

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:20.890
Die!

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:23.060
What's that?!

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:27.860
Take that!

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:28.630
And that!

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:34.240
Kirara, go higher!

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.480
l won't let you get away!

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:44.780
This isn't going to be easy.

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:46.750
We'll draw him away
from lnuyasha!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.360
Are you all right?

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:57.090
Uh-huh. . .

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:58.960
lt's been a long time.

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:04.830
So it's you guys, after all!

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:07.670
l knew you'd come back here.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.710
This time, you won't get away.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:15.780
At least give me
a proper welcome!

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:24.290
Nice sword. . .

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:26.290
lt's too good for you.

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:35.530
Still, it's no match for
my Wind Blade and Thunder Blade.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:36.830
lnuyasha!

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.700
Don't worry!
Stay back!

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:42.240
Wind Scar!

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:44.940
Earth Dragon Gale!

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:48.410
Wha-?!

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:51.720
That was nothing to get
excited about.

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:04.330
Hah! What a show-off!

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.930
Dragon Lightning!

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:24.480
lnuyasha!

00:22:30.710 --> 00:22:32.520
Man, that was dangerous!

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:34.290
A sacred arrow?

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:36.360
Do you want another one?!

00:22:36.380 --> 00:22:37.690
Stay outta this, Kagome!

00:22:39.090 --> 00:22:41.660
This guy's mine!

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:45.470
Hold it!

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:47.070
Are you running away?!

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:51.540
You're not as much fun
as l expected.

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:54.480
l thought you'd be stronger.

00:22:54.740 --> 00:22:56.710
l'll make you eat those words!

00:22:57.200 --> 00:22:58.750
Come back here!

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:04.290
Dammit!

00:23:04.310 --> 00:23:05.590
lnuyasha!

00:23:06.310 --> 00:23:07.720
Are you all right, lnuyasha?

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:09.990
lnuyasha. . .

00:23:11.150 --> 00:23:12.330
Kagome!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:15.330
You're both okay?

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:20.540
We turned them back somehow,
but they're going to be a problem.

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:27.180
Crimson Demon Fan!

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:34.620
How's that?

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:51.330
l've got to hand it to you, Sesshomaru. . .

00:24:06.410 --> 00:24:07.950
Dragon Strike!

00:24:20.490 --> 00:24:21.800
Magnificent!

00:24:22.390 --> 00:24:25.640
We'll cross swords again
on Horai lsland.

00:24:26.660 --> 00:24:28.370
Be sure to say your prayers.

00:24:29.030 --> 00:24:31.940
You will have very few options. . .

00:24:32.670 --> 00:24:36.080
as long as you bear the mark
of the Four War Gods.

00:24:47.280 --> 00:24:48.190
Humph!

00:24:51.490 --> 00:24:53.100
- Lord Sesshomaru!
- Lord Sesshomaru!

00:25:02.660 --> 00:25:04.540
What a shame!

00:25:04.570 --> 00:25:07.980
You missed him
by seconds!

00:25:08.140 --> 00:25:13.450
Oh but. . . You would never make
such a mistake!

00:25:14.140 --> 00:25:19.420
l see! You let him go on purpose and
are saving the pleasure for later.

00:25:22.820 --> 00:25:23.990
Lord Sesshomaru!

00:25:27.290 --> 00:25:28.870
Lord Sesshomaru. . .

00:25:33.560 --> 00:25:36.270
My name is Kujaku

00:25:36.300 --> 00:25:38.940
and l served your father
in the past.

00:25:39.470 --> 00:25:41.080
l am Seiten.

00:25:42.100 --> 00:25:43.950
My father is dead.

00:25:44.470 --> 00:25:45.750
We are aware of that.

00:25:46.640 --> 00:25:48.790
Then don't keep approaching me.

00:25:49.580 --> 00:25:50.650
P-Please wait!

00:25:50.810 --> 00:25:55.360
We are going to slay the Four War Gods
of Horai lsland.

00:25:55.650 --> 00:25:57.790
lt was your father's wish!

00:26:00.750 --> 00:26:02.130
l'm not interested.

00:26:02.390 --> 00:26:04.500
Lord Sesshomaru!

00:26:09.300 --> 00:26:10.870
Why you-!

00:26:15.100 --> 00:26:16.350
Lord Sesshomaru. . .

00:26:16.400 --> 00:26:17.250
l regret. . .

00:26:18.310 --> 00:26:19.980
He was nothing much.

00:26:21.610 --> 00:26:24.190
This will be my prize.

00:26:29.550 --> 00:26:31.530
So there was another one?

00:26:35.020 --> 00:26:39.800
So. . .you are "Lord" Sesshomaru?

00:26:40.290 --> 00:26:43.410
And you call yourself a god?

00:26:43.660 --> 00:26:44.610
Absolutely.

00:26:45.670 --> 00:26:46.580
Ridiculous!

00:26:59.250 --> 00:27:03.530
What was Father doing, battling
with these weaklings?

00:27:03.880 --> 00:27:06.730
Well, well. . . You are very strong.

00:27:08.020 --> 00:27:09.200
However. . .

00:27:09.220 --> 00:27:12.040
do not take lightly
the power of a god!

00:27:14.930 --> 00:27:19.080
You cannot escape me
any longer.

00:27:35.980 --> 00:27:37.530
U-Umm. . .Lord Sesshomaru?

00:27:37.850 --> 00:27:41.460
Are you going to slay the one
who got away, after all?

00:27:42.660 --> 00:27:44.630
There's no need for that.

00:27:44.660 --> 00:27:46.340
Oh, l knew that!

00:27:46.360 --> 00:27:50.140
You see, Rin?
Why on earth did you bring it up?

00:27:50.300 --> 00:27:52.380
l didn't say a thing!

00:28:05.050 --> 00:28:08.660
l cannot leave and allow this to continue.

00:28:29.570 --> 00:28:30.680
This way!

00:29:15.520 --> 00:29:16.560
lt's Ai!

00:29:16.820 --> 00:29:18.130
Ai is back!

00:29:19.020 --> 00:29:20.530
lnuyasha is with her!

00:29:20.950 --> 00:29:22.170
He came back. . .

00:29:31.060 --> 00:29:32.280
Wow!

00:29:33.330 --> 00:29:36.150
l've never seen
so many fireflies!

00:29:37.670 --> 00:29:40.650
Fireflies are beautiful,
but transient.

00:29:44.480 --> 00:29:48.160
Father once told me. . .

00:29:48.980 --> 00:29:57.030
The hand of a demon defends

00:29:57.930 --> 00:30:02.340
Mother once told me. . .

00:30:02.730 --> 00:30:11.210
The hand of a mortal nurtures

00:30:12.540 --> 00:30:20.090
Put both hands together
and open the gate

00:30:20.450 --> 00:30:29.530
Thou shalt go back
into the crimson flames

00:30:30.090 --> 00:30:44.010
Become the light and
protect the children

00:30:44.100 --> 00:30:51.220
Protect the children

00:30:56.850 --> 00:30:58.130
Sister. . .

00:31:00.250 --> 00:31:02.130
Sisters! Brothers!

00:31:02.160 --> 00:31:03.100
Ai. . .?

00:31:03.220 --> 00:31:04.500
Ai!

00:31:06.890 --> 00:31:08.470
Sister!

00:31:10.730 --> 00:31:13.080
Fool! Why did you come back?

00:31:13.400 --> 00:31:14.410
But. . .

00:31:14.430 --> 00:31:16.380
Don't scold the kid.

00:31:18.670 --> 00:31:20.480
Huh? lnuyasha!

00:31:20.870 --> 00:31:23.450
l'll destroy every one of
the Four War Gods.

00:31:23.710 --> 00:31:26.520
Hear that, Roku? He's going to
destroy the Four War Gods.

00:31:26.550 --> 00:31:29.430
There was a weakling who said
the very same thing 50 years ago,

00:31:29.450 --> 00:31:31.390
but ran away instead.
Right, Dai?

00:31:32.690 --> 00:31:33.860
- Ow!
- Ow!

00:31:34.020 --> 00:31:35.500
- Ow. . .
- Ow. . .

00:31:36.160 --> 00:31:37.970
Remember this, you two!

00:31:38.130 --> 00:31:41.300
lnuyasha has a short temper.
And he doesn't care if you're kids.

00:31:41.330 --> 00:31:42.410
You, too!

00:31:43.260 --> 00:31:45.540
Shion! Why are you hiding?

00:31:45.830 --> 00:31:47.580
l'm going to be gone soon.

00:31:48.240 --> 00:31:50.010
You're a boy! So shape up!

00:31:50.500 --> 00:31:52.210
But Sis. . . Maybe. . .

00:31:52.810 --> 00:31:55.650
lnuyasha, please get Ai
off this island.

00:31:56.310 --> 00:31:59.120
Ai still doesn't have
the mark of the Four War Gods,

00:31:59.150 --> 00:32:00.460
so she can leave.

00:32:00.750 --> 00:32:03.430
This mark you speak of. . .

00:32:03.820 --> 00:32:04.760
This is it.

00:32:07.290 --> 00:32:12.340
Whoever has the mark
cannot leave this island.

00:32:12.830 --> 00:32:14.670
You heard Moegi.

00:32:15.030 --> 00:32:17.510
That means lnuyasha can't
leave either.

00:32:17.530 --> 00:32:18.510
Huh?

00:32:18.700 --> 00:32:21.780
lnuyasha has the same scar.

00:32:22.000 --> 00:32:23.150
Then he's no help.

00:32:23.170 --> 00:32:27.180
He didn't come to save us.
He got drawn back here by the mark.

00:32:27.510 --> 00:32:28.580
Stupid!

00:32:29.410 --> 00:32:32.250
Then will you get Ai out of here?

00:32:32.680 --> 00:32:36.860
Will you explain more about this?
Umm. . .

00:32:37.280 --> 00:32:38.760
Her name's Asagi.

00:32:41.050 --> 00:32:42.230
Asagi?

00:32:45.390 --> 00:32:48.440
lt seems there is a barrier
around this island.

00:32:49.000 --> 00:32:51.370
That is why the children
cannot escape.

00:32:51.400 --> 00:32:55.480
Then lnuyasha, we must destroy
the source of the barrier.

00:32:56.370 --> 00:32:58.950
That's impossible. . .

00:32:59.370 --> 00:33:01.420
But lnuyasha can. . .

00:33:01.440 --> 00:33:02.650
You be quiet!

00:33:03.110 --> 00:33:05.660
lf we do something that
angers the Four War Gods,

00:33:05.680 --> 00:33:07.620
you all may be killed too!

00:33:21.500 --> 00:33:23.170
Asagi. . .

00:33:25.130 --> 00:33:27.540
The Cauldron of Resonance
is calling. . .

00:33:28.040 --> 00:33:29.580
The Cauldron of Resonance?

00:33:30.500 --> 00:33:31.880
We must go. . .

00:33:31.910 --> 00:33:33.380
Go where?

00:33:33.740 --> 00:33:37.050
This doesn't concern you.
Please leave us alone!

00:33:38.780 --> 00:33:42.260
ldiot! You're too cocky for a kid!

00:33:42.450 --> 00:33:43.990
lnuyasha! Sit!

00:33:44.890 --> 00:33:46.830
What a thing to do to a girl!

00:33:46.850 --> 00:33:47.630
S-She's. . .

00:33:47.650 --> 00:33:48.960
. . .so strong!

00:33:53.030 --> 00:33:55.140
Wait, Asagi!

00:33:55.460 --> 00:33:58.240
l wonder what is going on here.

00:33:58.570 --> 00:33:59.910
Let us go, too.

00:34:00.730 --> 00:34:02.010
Come on, Shippo!

00:34:02.100 --> 00:34:03.110
'Kay!

00:34:05.010 --> 00:34:08.650
H-Hey wait!
Don't leave me!

00:34:16.180 --> 00:34:19.400
No one else lives on this island?

00:34:19.720 --> 00:34:21.160
There is just us.

00:34:21.290 --> 00:34:25.270
There used to be many more,
but they all died.

00:34:26.460 --> 00:34:30.170
That was a very sad song.
What's it called?

00:34:30.760 --> 00:34:32.440
lt's the Song of Parting.

00:34:32.530 --> 00:34:36.050
Lady Kanade said it was originally
a funeral song.

00:34:36.340 --> 00:34:37.480
Lady Kanade?

00:34:37.500 --> 00:34:39.280
The priestess of the shrine.

00:34:39.740 --> 00:34:42.280
She sounds like a very
beautiful woman.

00:34:42.310 --> 00:34:43.450
Ahem!

00:34:44.750 --> 00:34:46.690
Lady Kanade is gone now.

00:34:46.780 --> 00:34:49.230
She fought with the Four War Gods
and died.

00:34:49.720 --> 00:34:52.930
Now, the sacrificial offering
to the Four War Gods. . .

00:34:53.120 --> 00:34:55.600
Shion! Don't talk so much!

00:34:59.230 --> 00:35:01.700
Sacrificial offering?
Now that sounds ominous.

00:35:01.730 --> 00:35:03.810
You aren't planning to die?

00:35:09.140 --> 00:35:10.210
Asagi!

00:35:20.710 --> 00:35:22.120
Asagi. . .

00:35:23.580 --> 00:35:26.660
l'm going to become a firefly.

00:35:27.450 --> 00:35:28.430
A firefly?

00:35:28.660 --> 00:35:31.730
These fireflies are the souls of
the villagers who jumped

00:35:31.760 --> 00:35:34.170
into the Cauldron of Resonance
and died.

00:35:34.430 --> 00:35:38.670
Our mothers and fathers,
our brothers and sisters.

00:35:39.770 --> 00:35:43.450
They all became fireflies
and watch over us.

00:35:43.840 --> 00:35:46.020
That's why we're not lonely.

00:35:47.710 --> 00:35:50.490
l'll become a firefly and
watch over these kids, too!

00:35:51.210 --> 00:35:54.060
So please. . .!
Don't stop me!

00:35:55.580 --> 00:35:56.890
Asagi. . .

00:35:57.620 --> 00:35:59.800
Hah! l don't like any of this!

00:36:11.700 --> 00:36:15.280
The Cauldron of Resonance used to be
something sacred

00:36:15.300 --> 00:36:18.680
which protected the demons and mortals
who lived here,

00:36:18.710 --> 00:36:20.480
and their half-demon descendants.

00:36:21.310 --> 00:36:24.290
But the Four War Gods polluted it.

00:36:24.980 --> 00:36:28.160
The Four War Gods used
the tainted Cauldron

00:36:28.180 --> 00:36:31.090
to suck out the power
from half-demons like us.

00:36:31.220 --> 00:36:33.430
That's how they get their power.

00:36:33.850 --> 00:36:36.370
So many have been sacrificed already.

00:36:36.420 --> 00:36:40.100
Once every fifty years, when the island
becomes a part of the outside world,

00:36:40.130 --> 00:36:41.970
the Cauldron calls for a sacrifice.

00:36:43.460 --> 00:36:46.810
After Asagi, it'll be me or Dai.

00:36:52.110 --> 00:36:53.480
lt's so hot.

00:36:53.810 --> 00:36:56.190
And there's an extraordinary
demonic aura.

00:37:10.520 --> 00:37:12.570
So this is the Cauldron of Resonance?

00:37:12.760 --> 00:37:15.400
lt's really creepy.

00:37:15.430 --> 00:37:17.910
Nah! lt's big, s'all.

00:37:18.670 --> 00:37:23.750
Good-bye. . .everyone.
Don't fight, okay?

00:37:24.100 --> 00:37:26.620
Asagi! l don't want you to go!

00:37:28.710 --> 00:37:31.650
l'll be a firefly protecting you all.

00:37:32.280 --> 00:37:35.720
There must be a way to get out
without sacrificing yourself!

00:37:35.750 --> 00:37:37.030
Let's all think hard.

00:37:37.550 --> 00:37:39.830
l'll help slay the demons.

00:37:39.920 --> 00:37:42.260
Asagi, let's ask them to help us.

00:37:43.960 --> 00:37:46.470
You don't know how vicious
the Four War Gods are.

00:37:47.290 --> 00:37:48.200
But. . .

00:37:48.630 --> 00:37:52.840
With one sacrifice, the rest of the children
can keep living for a while longer.

00:37:53.470 --> 00:37:56.110
lt's not for the Four War Gods!
lt's for all of you!

00:38:16.320 --> 00:38:17.870
Don't follow me!

00:38:17.960 --> 00:38:19.440
No can do.

00:38:19.460 --> 00:38:21.570
Unless the source of the barrier
is destroyed,

00:38:21.590 --> 00:38:23.610
l can't get outta here.

00:38:47.490 --> 00:38:49.300
lf you're scared, go and hide!

00:38:49.920 --> 00:38:52.100
Stop! Don't interfere!

00:38:53.630 --> 00:38:55.700
Wind Scar!

00:38:58.330 --> 00:38:59.980
- Dammit!
- l said, stop!

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:02.810
lf l sacrifice myself,
everyone will be saved!

00:39:03.070 --> 00:39:04.380
Shaddup!

00:39:04.400 --> 00:39:06.450
Don't think about dying so easily!

00:39:09.310 --> 00:39:10.520
- lnuyasha!
- Asagi!

00:39:32.430 --> 00:39:34.940
Hang in there!
We're not dead yet!

00:39:35.540 --> 00:39:36.910
Don't give up, idiot!

00:39:38.840 --> 00:39:39.620
Damn!

00:40:00.530 --> 00:40:02.100
W-What is that?!

00:40:08.130 --> 00:40:11.650
Asagi!
Don't give up on me!

00:40:15.980 --> 00:40:17.590
What is that?

00:40:18.110 --> 00:40:19.420
Asagi. . .

00:40:19.450 --> 00:40:20.160
Huh?

00:40:41.200 --> 00:40:43.550
Looks as if we've been rejuvenated
once again.

00:40:43.570 --> 00:40:47.380
Dammit! How long must
we keep doing this?!

00:40:47.640 --> 00:40:49.890
There are five half-demon children left.

00:40:50.380 --> 00:40:52.190
Before they are all sacrificed,

00:40:52.210 --> 00:40:55.520
we must find a way
to get our true power back.

00:40:56.450 --> 00:40:59.500
That's why we have that
priestess ready.

00:41:02.620 --> 00:41:04.500
Asagi jumped into the Cauldron.

00:41:04.520 --> 00:41:05.600
Poor thing. . .

00:41:05.790 --> 00:41:08.770
But, Asagi hasn't come to us
as a firefly yet.

00:41:08.860 --> 00:41:10.310
Could she still be alive?

00:41:13.270 --> 00:41:14.840
lt's no good!
This won't even budge!

00:41:15.030 --> 00:41:17.410
What'll happen to
lnuyasha and Asagi?!

00:41:18.240 --> 00:41:19.620
Both of you, get back!

00:41:23.410 --> 00:41:25.220
Cut it out.
lt's useless.

00:41:25.480 --> 00:41:28.290
No one's ever come out
of this cauldron alive.

00:41:28.680 --> 00:41:30.530
They're both dead.

00:41:30.550 --> 00:41:33.860
We can't give up!
There must be a way!

00:41:39.830 --> 00:41:42.970
l wonder if these shapes
have some meaning.

00:41:43.660 --> 00:41:45.510
"Father once told me. . .

00:41:45.530 --> 00:41:47.640
"The hand of a demon defends

00:41:48.200 --> 00:41:49.480
"Mother once told me. . .

00:41:49.700 --> 00:41:52.180
"The hand of a mortal nurtures. . ."

00:41:53.670 --> 00:41:54.980
That's the song you sang.

00:41:55.010 --> 00:41:58.720
The song is carved into
the gate in ancient writing.

00:41:59.080 --> 00:42:01.890
Do you know what
the "hand that defends" is?

00:42:02.580 --> 00:42:04.590
The left hand. What else?

00:42:04.620 --> 00:42:06.660
Don't you even know that?!

00:42:07.050 --> 00:42:09.460
Then what about
the "hand that nurtures"?

00:42:09.620 --> 00:42:10.870
The right hand!

00:42:10.920 --> 00:42:12.100
What about the rest of the song?

00:42:13.390 --> 00:42:15.700
"Put both hands together
and open the gate

00:42:15.930 --> 00:42:17.940
"Thou shalt go back
into the crimson flames

00:42:18.360 --> 00:42:21.180
"Become the light and
protect the children."

00:42:22.270 --> 00:42:24.480
"Put both hands together
and open the gate. . ."

00:42:25.510 --> 00:42:27.520
Miroku, that means. . .

00:42:28.140 --> 00:42:28.850
Yes!

00:42:29.540 --> 00:42:32.960
lf we put the left hand of a demon
and the right hand of a mortal together,

00:42:32.980 --> 00:42:34.060
the gate will open.

00:42:43.160 --> 00:42:44.830
See, didn't work!

00:42:44.860 --> 00:42:46.300
l shouldn't have gotten my hopes up!

00:42:46.660 --> 00:42:49.300
"Put both hands together."
l wonder what it means?

00:42:52.370 --> 00:42:53.840
W-What are those?!

00:42:54.170 --> 00:42:55.540
Man-eating poison insects!

00:43:09.520 --> 00:43:10.530
Dammit!

00:43:10.650 --> 00:43:12.730
My vision's getting blurry.

00:43:14.420 --> 00:43:16.100
lsn't there a way out?!

00:43:16.790 --> 00:43:19.670
A living being made it all
the way here. . .

00:43:20.060 --> 00:43:21.740
You must be a half-demon.

00:43:22.260 --> 00:43:24.970
Why were you not consumed by
the flames of the crimson fire?

00:43:25.870 --> 00:43:28.940
Probably thanks to
this Robe of the Fire-rat.

00:43:29.040 --> 00:43:30.350
But who are you?

00:43:31.000 --> 00:43:34.850
l am Kanade, the guardian priestess
of Horai lsland.

00:43:35.640 --> 00:43:40.160
Then you can tell me what happened
on this island.

00:43:41.610 --> 00:43:42.990
Wind Tunnel!

00:43:47.390 --> 00:43:49.970
Miroku, they're poison insects!
You can't suck them in!

00:43:58.560 --> 00:44:01.340
Eaten by poison insects
or by the flames in the cauldron. . .

00:44:01.370 --> 00:44:02.210
Which is better?

00:44:02.240 --> 00:44:03.510
Well. . .

00:44:03.700 --> 00:44:06.350
Let's look for something
to use as weapons, too.

00:44:06.370 --> 00:44:08.150
- Sister!
- Moegi!

00:44:08.640 --> 00:44:11.120
Oh well, we'd better look, too.

00:44:11.310 --> 00:44:12.250
Okay!

00:44:15.010 --> 00:44:17.560
Awright, l'm using
special fox magic!

00:44:17.580 --> 00:44:19.230
Shippo, here. . .

00:44:21.820 --> 00:44:24.330
"lf you are not authorized
to be here, leave at once.

00:44:24.760 --> 00:44:26.770
"This place does not belong to you.

00:44:27.690 --> 00:44:31.170
"Only those who possess
love and tenderness

00:44:31.200 --> 00:44:33.340
"shall be allowed to
place their hands here."

00:44:35.340 --> 00:44:36.210
That's it!

00:44:36.640 --> 00:44:38.750
Kagome, we've solved
the mystery of the song!

00:44:41.910 --> 00:44:44.650
Many ages ago, Horai lsland
was a paradise

00:44:44.680 --> 00:44:47.790
where mortals and demons
lived in harmony.

00:44:48.510 --> 00:44:50.760
ln time, many half-demons
were born

00:44:50.780 --> 00:44:52.690
and everyone lived in peace.

00:44:53.850 --> 00:44:57.230
However, elsewhere, mortals
would find half-demons distasteful

00:44:57.260 --> 00:44:59.330
while demons would look
down upon them.

00:45:00.090 --> 00:45:03.210
lt would be difficult to live
on the outside.

00:45:04.230 --> 00:45:07.410
ln order to protect these children
for all eternity

00:45:07.430 --> 00:45:10.050
we decided to sever our ties
to the outside world.

00:45:11.370 --> 00:45:15.280
But every fifty years, when the time
barrier became weak,

00:45:15.510 --> 00:45:17.750
demons would attack.

00:45:19.250 --> 00:45:21.390
The Four War Gods were among them.

00:45:24.320 --> 00:45:26.290
There was great bloodshed.

00:45:28.350 --> 00:45:31.200
We fought, too. But it was
all we could do

00:45:31.220 --> 00:45:35.300
to seal their spheres of power
in this cauldron at the cost of our lives.

00:45:37.030 --> 00:45:40.540
They realized that by throwing living
half-demons into the cauldron,

00:45:40.570 --> 00:45:43.480
they could retrieve a small portion
of their power.

00:45:44.140 --> 00:45:45.680
But why half-demons?

00:45:46.140 --> 00:45:48.620
Normally, the spiritual power
that a human possesses

00:45:48.640 --> 00:45:51.250
clashes with the demon power
of a demon.

00:45:51.880 --> 00:45:54.760
However, in a half-demon,
the two powers blend.

00:45:55.280 --> 00:46:00.160
lt is this synergy of power
which keeps this cauldron burning.

00:46:00.790 --> 00:46:01.900
Ready. . .!

00:46:05.730 --> 00:46:06.740
Are you okay?

00:46:06.860 --> 00:46:08.370
- No, we're not!
- No, we're not!

00:46:08.560 --> 00:46:10.040
l'm not asking you!

00:46:26.680 --> 00:46:28.620
We're ready on this side, Shippo!

00:46:30.220 --> 00:46:31.360
Over here, too!

00:46:32.250 --> 00:46:32.990
One!

00:46:33.420 --> 00:46:34.360
Two!

00:46:34.790 --> 00:46:35.560
Three!

00:46:48.370 --> 00:46:49.510
lt opened!

00:46:52.840 --> 00:46:55.520
Huh? What's. . .this light?

00:46:56.440 --> 00:46:57.450
This light. . .?

00:46:57.940 --> 00:46:59.890
lt can't be that the gate opened!

00:47:00.210 --> 00:47:02.260
Which means. . .that's the exit.

00:47:05.750 --> 00:47:07.960
The cauldron has absorbed
your power, hasn't it?

00:47:08.490 --> 00:47:09.430
So be it.

00:47:09.960 --> 00:47:13.270
l shall pass on what
little life l have left.

00:47:14.090 --> 00:47:17.040
ln exchange, save these children.

00:47:18.030 --> 00:47:20.740
What happens to the kids
is up to them.

00:47:21.470 --> 00:47:24.410
All l'm gonna do
is destroy the Four War Gods!

00:47:24.470 --> 00:47:27.080
That is fine.
You have my blessings.

00:47:38.890 --> 00:47:41.360
Asagi!
We're gonna get outta here now.

00:47:42.190 --> 00:47:44.070
ls. . .it okay to stay alive?

00:47:44.490 --> 00:47:46.800
Quit asking permission like that!

00:47:47.190 --> 00:47:47.900
Wait.

00:47:49.860 --> 00:47:50.770
Lady Kanade?

00:47:54.370 --> 00:47:56.440
lt stopped! Why?

00:47:57.040 --> 00:47:59.050
Maybe there's not enough demon power.

00:47:59.140 --> 00:48:00.220
'Cuz you're so puny.

00:48:04.280 --> 00:48:05.320
What is it?

00:48:06.080 --> 00:48:07.260
Ajeweled comb box.

00:48:08.210 --> 00:48:10.990
The power spheres of the Four War Gods
are sealed inside.

00:48:11.020 --> 00:48:12.690
l have guarded it until now.

00:48:13.420 --> 00:48:14.800
lt must never be opened.

00:48:15.690 --> 00:48:16.770
lf opened,
it will spell the end.

00:48:16.790 --> 00:48:18.570
The spheres will return
to the Four War Gods

00:48:18.590 --> 00:48:21.000
and they will become invincible.

00:48:21.330 --> 00:48:23.940
Then all l have to do is
destroy it, box and all.

00:48:24.800 --> 00:48:26.110
Kagome! Can you hear me?

00:48:28.670 --> 00:48:30.350
lnuyasha! Are you alive?

00:48:31.240 --> 00:48:32.280
What about Asagi?

00:48:33.070 --> 00:48:34.220
She's with me!

00:48:34.540 --> 00:48:36.220
l'm gonna break down
the gate!

00:48:36.740 --> 00:48:38.720
Get away from the front of it!

00:48:40.050 --> 00:48:40.920
Gotcha!

00:48:41.550 --> 00:48:43.460
Everyone, move away
from the front of the gate.

00:48:43.480 --> 00:48:45.330
lnuyasha and Asagi
are coming back.

00:48:45.590 --> 00:48:46.560
Sango!

00:48:52.860 --> 00:48:53.700
Asagi. . .

00:48:53.730 --> 00:48:57.140
Forgive me.
Perhaps l was wrong.

00:48:57.430 --> 00:48:58.210
Huh?

00:48:58.460 --> 00:49:00.840
l will pray for your happiness.

00:49:01.230 --> 00:49:02.380
Lady Kanade. . .

00:49:05.240 --> 00:49:08.150
Adamant Barrage!

00:49:40.810 --> 00:49:44.290
That lnuyasha! Doesn't he know
the meaning of restraint?

00:49:44.410 --> 00:49:45.350
The idiot!

00:49:45.910 --> 00:49:48.490
Man! lt's nice and cool outside!

00:49:54.720 --> 00:49:56.000
Asagi!

00:49:57.220 --> 00:49:58.530
Ai! Everyone!

00:49:58.720 --> 00:50:00.040
Asagi!

00:50:11.700 --> 00:50:13.580
The jeweled comb box. . .

00:50:13.770 --> 00:50:16.350
has come out of the cauldron.

00:50:17.140 --> 00:50:21.090
Bringing it out for us. . .
What a nice guy.

00:50:21.210 --> 00:50:25.790
Hah! Now our original power
will be restored.

00:50:26.320 --> 00:50:27.600
Not so fast.

00:50:27.620 --> 00:50:30.300
We must first take
possession of the box.

00:50:31.060 --> 00:50:35.340
Well, we may as well
test the power of that priestess.

00:51:13.130 --> 00:51:15.780
And. . .!

00:51:20.240 --> 00:51:23.080
Sheesh! You couldn't break it!

00:51:23.510 --> 00:51:26.050
And you sounded so confident!
What a lame dog!

00:51:26.150 --> 00:51:27.560
Why you-!

00:51:30.420 --> 00:51:33.700
The barrier around the box
seems to be extremely strong.

00:51:35.120 --> 00:51:38.930
Perhaps Kagome with
her spiritual power can open it.

00:51:39.860 --> 00:51:42.270
But we're not supposed to
open it, right?

00:51:42.660 --> 00:51:44.170
Kagome, where are your arrows?

00:51:44.200 --> 00:51:44.770
Huh?

00:51:45.660 --> 00:51:47.580
Where'd l put them?

00:51:48.330 --> 00:51:50.350
Are you talking about those. . .?

00:51:54.210 --> 00:51:55.180
Sorry.

00:51:55.880 --> 00:51:58.720
We're in the company of fools, huh?

00:51:58.740 --> 00:51:59.890
l'll say!

00:52:04.420 --> 00:52:07.000
You two! We're doing this for you!

00:52:07.190 --> 00:52:09.630
Think before you shoot
your mouth off!

00:52:18.500 --> 00:52:20.310
K-Kikyo!

00:52:27.870 --> 00:52:28.820
lnuyasha!

00:52:29.480 --> 00:52:30.690
Are you all okay?

00:52:30.910 --> 00:52:32.190
Yes, l'm good.

00:52:32.310 --> 00:52:34.960
Tetsusaiga's sheathe
protected us!

00:52:44.820 --> 00:52:46.070
The box was taken!

00:52:46.330 --> 00:52:47.140
Kikyo!

00:52:47.460 --> 00:52:49.070
Was that really Kikyo?

00:52:49.830 --> 00:52:51.170
That Kikyo. . .

00:52:51.460 --> 00:52:53.410
didn't have the smell
of graveyard soil!

00:52:54.930 --> 00:52:55.880
lnuyasha!

00:52:56.270 --> 00:52:59.380
Kagome! Get the kids
off this island!

00:53:01.210 --> 00:53:02.320
lnuyasha!

00:53:04.510 --> 00:53:06.590
l think there's
a love triangle in this.

00:53:06.810 --> 00:53:08.120
You mean, a guy
and two women?

00:53:10.950 --> 00:53:13.960
What are you up to?
Let's get going!

00:53:14.050 --> 00:53:14.830
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:53:22.260 --> 00:53:23.340
She's upset. . .

00:53:23.530 --> 00:53:25.470
Kagome is scary.

00:53:33.040 --> 00:53:34.920
Good work.

00:53:38.880 --> 00:53:40.720
Hurry it up and open it!

00:53:46.150 --> 00:53:47.630
Wait, Kikyo!

00:53:49.920 --> 00:53:52.770
Have you come to take
back your old lover?

00:53:53.330 --> 00:53:54.170
Why you-!

00:53:58.060 --> 00:53:59.940
Now open it, Kikyo!

00:54:00.470 --> 00:54:01.410
Stop!

00:54:01.430 --> 00:54:03.110
Don't you recognize me?!

00:54:03.140 --> 00:54:05.010
l wonder about that.

00:54:05.740 --> 00:54:08.020
She's a doppelganger
made from blood that

00:54:08.040 --> 00:54:10.250
Gora sucked out of Kikyo
fifty years ago.

00:54:10.740 --> 00:54:11.920
What?!

00:54:11.940 --> 00:54:14.060
And it was all to get
this box back

00:54:14.080 --> 00:54:16.860
and repossess our stolen spheres.

00:54:17.180 --> 00:54:20.900
We can't break the barrier
around the box.

00:54:24.320 --> 00:54:25.870
Hurry and open it up.

00:54:26.560 --> 00:54:27.670
Stop!

00:54:44.280 --> 00:54:45.750
lt's been so long!

00:55:01.030 --> 00:55:03.000
Thunder Cannon!

00:55:10.670 --> 00:55:12.550
Birds of Fire!

00:55:21.950 --> 00:55:22.760
Dammit!

00:55:37.530 --> 00:55:38.540
Kikyo!

00:55:40.830 --> 00:55:43.610
Hah! Can't take on a mere woman?!

00:55:44.170 --> 00:55:49.980
Awright! Before we leave Horai lsland,
we'll slaughter everyone in the village!

00:55:55.180 --> 00:55:55.990
Wha-?!

00:55:57.120 --> 00:55:58.130
Huh?!

00:55:59.120 --> 00:55:59.990
lt's him!

00:56:00.020 --> 00:56:00.900
Let's go!

00:56:01.120 --> 00:56:03.770
Kagome! Shippo!
Take care of the children!

00:56:03.920 --> 00:56:04.630
Right!

00:56:05.260 --> 00:56:06.070
Got it!

00:56:06.090 --> 00:56:07.100
Leave it to us!

00:56:14.100 --> 00:56:17.540
As long as the children have
the mark of the Four War Gods,

00:56:17.540 --> 00:56:17.550
they cannot get off the island.
As long as the children have
the mark of the Four War Gods,

00:56:17.550 --> 00:56:19.850
they cannot get off the island.

00:56:20.410 --> 00:56:23.520
Which means we have no option
but to destroy those demons!

00:56:33.790 --> 00:56:34.830
Hiraikotsu!

00:57:09.660 --> 00:57:12.000
Damn! How far is she gonna
pursue me?!

00:57:16.830 --> 00:57:18.370
See, didn't l tell you?

00:57:18.930 --> 00:57:21.910
The boat hasn't been
used in decades!

00:57:22.500 --> 00:57:24.510
Asagi, let's make it.

00:57:24.800 --> 00:57:28.720
Yes! We can make one ourselves!
Let's do it!

00:57:28.740 --> 00:57:29.380
Uh-huh!

00:57:30.110 --> 00:57:33.860
Shippo, take Dai, Roku and Shion
and gather logs.

00:57:33.880 --> 00:57:37.260
Try to get ones that are straight,
with the same diameter and length.

00:57:37.750 --> 00:57:39.560
Sheesh, l guess l have no choice.

00:57:39.790 --> 00:57:42.160
Awright, follow me!

00:57:44.860 --> 00:57:47.270
Hey! Listen to your boss!

00:57:47.630 --> 00:57:50.400
Moegi and Ai, go and find
rope and large pieces of fabric

00:57:50.430 --> 00:57:51.910
with which to tie the logs.

00:57:51.930 --> 00:57:52.640
Okay!

00:57:52.870 --> 00:57:55.110
Asagi, you can help me
make the raft.

00:57:55.270 --> 00:57:55.940
Uh-huh!

00:58:04.040 --> 00:58:05.890
She's not the real Kikyo!

00:58:06.650 --> 00:58:08.120
l know that!

00:58:30.500 --> 00:58:33.650
Sesshomaru, l have been
waiting for you.

00:58:40.150 --> 00:58:41.390
Fine.

00:58:41.780 --> 00:58:44.430
l will gladly be your opponent.

00:58:55.530 --> 00:58:59.270
Hey, quit running away!

00:58:59.300 --> 00:59:00.240
Hiraikotsu!

00:59:02.370 --> 00:59:03.580
Thunder Cannon!

00:59:13.280 --> 00:59:15.760
There's no other way
but to suck him in.

00:59:16.220 --> 00:59:16.990
Miroku!

00:59:17.020 --> 00:59:18.390
Your Wind Tunnel isn't. . . !

00:59:18.420 --> 00:59:20.160
No, he's nothing!

00:59:20.590 --> 00:59:21.860
Wind Tunnel!

00:59:33.500 --> 00:59:35.140
My Thunder Cannon. . .!

00:59:41.210 --> 00:59:42.920
Unforgivable!

00:59:57.590 --> 01:00:00.230
This is my. . .

01:00:00.260 --> 01:00:01.440
true power!

01:00:32.060 --> 01:00:34.040
Dammit. . . l. . .!

01:00:34.560 --> 01:00:35.700
l. . .!

01:01:04.160 --> 01:01:05.570
K-Kikyo. . . !

01:01:07.630 --> 01:01:11.040
Letting yourself be distracted
by such an abomination. . .

01:01:11.700 --> 01:01:12.610
How pathetic!

01:01:26.510 --> 01:01:27.790
Birds of Fire!

01:01:46.230 --> 01:01:49.110
lsn't this fun, Sesshomaru?

01:01:49.270 --> 01:01:51.480
We are kindred spirits.

01:01:52.100 --> 01:01:53.480
You are out of your mind.

01:01:56.170 --> 01:01:58.520
We feel joy in fighting,

01:01:58.610 --> 01:02:01.120
we feel alive when we kill. . .

01:02:01.550 --> 01:02:04.690
What is different between
you and me?

01:02:04.980 --> 01:02:07.960
Do not put me in
the same wretched class as yourself!

01:02:18.600 --> 01:02:19.770
Crimson Demon Fan!

01:02:25.100 --> 01:02:28.180
Then tell me how we differ!

01:02:32.180 --> 01:02:34.720
l have no need to speak to you.

01:02:36.280 --> 01:02:37.220
Dragon Strike!

01:02:48.890 --> 01:02:50.370
What's wrong?

01:02:50.960 --> 01:02:52.970
ls it over already?

01:02:59.700 --> 01:03:03.880
l seek to battle the strongest
one alive. . .

01:03:04.010 --> 01:03:05.820
And you are not one of them!

01:03:57.130 --> 01:03:58.310
Asagi!

01:03:59.230 --> 01:04:01.310
The mark on your back is gone!

01:04:02.200 --> 01:04:02.980
Really?

01:04:05.240 --> 01:04:06.150
You're right!

01:04:06.340 --> 01:04:08.750
One of the Four War Gods
must have been beaten.

01:04:09.140 --> 01:04:10.620
But only one. . .

01:04:11.080 --> 01:04:12.750
means there're three left.

01:04:12.880 --> 01:04:16.190
Kagome, we'll be saved,
won't we?

01:04:16.650 --> 01:04:19.030
Yes, l'm sure of it!

01:04:19.680 --> 01:04:22.000
Now then, we're almost done.
Let's get to work!

01:04:22.090 --> 01:04:22.830
Okay!

01:04:23.490 --> 01:04:25.300
Shion, please get the rope.

01:04:29.360 --> 01:04:30.070
Huh?

01:04:31.230 --> 01:04:32.440
What's wrong, Shion. . .?

01:04:38.070 --> 01:04:38.810
Ryura!

01:04:40.770 --> 01:04:43.250
What're you doing over there?

01:04:44.640 --> 01:04:45.390
Shion!

01:04:45.680 --> 01:04:48.790
There's no need
to rush outta here.

01:04:49.350 --> 01:04:52.890
As long as you have at least one of
the marks on your back,

01:04:52.920 --> 01:04:54.700
you can't leave this island.

01:04:56.220 --> 01:04:58.300
l-l'm sorry.

01:04:59.060 --> 01:05:01.100
Your business with this island
is over, isn't it?

01:05:01.290 --> 01:05:02.400
Get out of the way!

01:05:05.100 --> 01:05:07.240
A girl with spirit!
l like that.

01:05:07.370 --> 01:05:09.510
Well, l detest guys like you!

01:05:09.870 --> 01:05:12.810
You're a coward who loves
to pick on children!

01:05:12.870 --> 01:05:15.050
Right! Right!
You're a pervert!

01:05:16.370 --> 01:05:19.050
We know that one of you
was killed.

01:05:19.310 --> 01:05:20.320
Just watch!

01:05:20.350 --> 01:05:23.390
lnuyasha will get every
last one of you!

01:05:23.820 --> 01:05:27.600
Damn, what an unlucky draw l had.

01:05:28.150 --> 01:05:30.500
A human woman and half-demons. . .

01:05:30.520 --> 01:05:33.400
There's no fun in this.

01:05:34.060 --> 01:05:35.970
l'm a full-fledged demon!

01:05:42.630 --> 01:05:44.980
That time with Kanade,

01:05:45.000 --> 01:05:47.950
we made a mistake in
letting a mortal woman live.

01:05:52.380 --> 01:05:57.190
We should've killed her immediately. . .
the one with the spiritual powers.

01:06:11.200 --> 01:06:12.210
Hiraiko-!

01:06:40.690 --> 01:06:42.100
This is fun!

01:06:43.160 --> 01:06:45.910
Sango, we need to get them to
take each other out.

01:06:46.930 --> 01:06:47.840
Kirara!

01:07:01.650 --> 01:07:03.560
Damn!
As if l'd let you get away!

01:07:28.940 --> 01:07:30.150
Now, Sango!

01:07:30.180 --> 01:07:30.750
Right!

01:07:32.080 --> 01:07:33.750
l won't fall for your tricks!

01:07:36.510 --> 01:07:39.290
Oh yes, you will!

01:07:39.720 --> 01:07:40.890
Wind Tunnel!

01:08:20.460 --> 01:08:22.000
All right. One more to go.

01:08:31.270 --> 01:08:32.210
Kagome!

01:08:32.600 --> 01:08:36.480
l'll take good care of
the brats, so don't worry.

01:08:37.680 --> 01:08:38.850
Hey! Ryura!

01:08:39.980 --> 01:08:42.160
One more mark is gone!

01:08:42.410 --> 01:08:43.620
Only two left!

01:08:44.050 --> 01:08:46.490
The Four War Gods
weren't much, after all!

01:08:46.580 --> 01:08:49.560
Hey! Don't antagonize him more!

01:08:49.790 --> 01:08:52.630
They're right!
The Four War Gods are weak!

01:08:52.660 --> 01:08:53.270
Moegi!

01:08:53.290 --> 01:08:55.270
Get away from Kagome!

01:08:56.090 --> 01:09:00.110
We're not afraid of you anymore!
Leave this island!

01:09:01.300 --> 01:09:02.380
L-Leave!

01:09:02.630 --> 01:09:04.180
lt's all over!

01:09:04.670 --> 01:09:05.680
Don't worry.

01:09:05.700 --> 01:09:08.120
l can't get serious
over brats!

01:09:08.870 --> 01:09:09.820
Transform!

01:09:12.080 --> 01:09:13.120
Shippo!

01:09:13.950 --> 01:09:15.020
ls everyone all right?

01:09:15.380 --> 01:09:17.620
Thank you, Shippo!

01:09:22.550 --> 01:09:23.230
Huh?!

01:09:31.230 --> 01:09:33.270
lnuyasha!

01:09:33.570 --> 01:09:35.610
Get away from Kagome!

01:09:37.500 --> 01:09:40.010
l'm. . .your opponent!

01:09:46.110 --> 01:09:48.520
Taking on the Four War Gods. . .

01:09:48.880 --> 01:09:50.760
is a hundred years too early for you!

01:09:53.450 --> 01:09:54.290
lnuyasha!

01:09:55.450 --> 01:09:57.060
Gods? Forget it!

01:09:57.090 --> 01:09:59.830
You're just fooling yourselves!

01:10:09.730 --> 01:10:11.980
Wind Scar!

01:10:14.910 --> 01:10:16.580
Dragon Gale!

01:10:18.410 --> 01:10:21.520
Take this!
Adamant Barrage!

01:10:26.450 --> 01:10:27.630
How naive!

01:10:27.690 --> 01:10:29.900
Who do you think l am?

01:10:30.090 --> 01:10:30.730
Wha-!

01:11:06.760 --> 01:11:07.870
lnuyasha. . .

01:11:11.160 --> 01:11:13.240
Hang in there, lnuyasha!

01:11:15.670 --> 01:11:19.610
lnuyasha. . .

01:11:27.110 --> 01:11:28.920
l admit, l had a little bit of fun.

01:11:38.460 --> 01:11:40.230
Don't be crazy! You can't win!

01:11:42.060 --> 01:11:43.540
Oh, whatever!

01:11:43.730 --> 01:11:45.010
Die!

01:11:51.500 --> 01:11:53.450
Don't get carried away.

01:11:54.210 --> 01:11:57.050
Curse you! We won't lose!

01:11:59.810 --> 01:12:02.090
Enough. Get back!

01:12:05.950 --> 01:12:08.460
lnuyasha!

01:12:09.120 --> 01:12:11.230
l understand how you feel.

01:12:12.120 --> 01:12:14.200
That you want to get off this island. . .

01:12:14.760 --> 01:12:16.770
That you don't wanna die. . .

01:12:17.600 --> 01:12:20.010
That you're willing to take
on this fight. . .

01:12:20.770 --> 01:12:23.210
That you want to beat
the Four War Gods. . .

01:12:23.700 --> 01:12:25.110
That's why. . .

01:12:25.340 --> 01:12:26.910
you can leave the rest. . .

01:12:27.210 --> 01:12:29.820
to me!

01:12:54.670 --> 01:12:55.810
One more to go.

01:13:11.420 --> 01:13:13.060
He intends to destroy this island!

01:13:16.490 --> 01:13:17.500
lnuyasha!

01:13:17.720 --> 01:13:19.670
Gora is attacking the island!

01:13:20.430 --> 01:13:22.540
He could be planning to
sink the entire island.

01:13:22.690 --> 01:13:24.970
So l'll just beat the crap
outta that overgrown turtle!

01:13:46.180 --> 01:13:47.060
lnuyasha!

01:14:28.790 --> 01:14:30.300
Backlash Wave!

01:15:09.730 --> 01:15:11.010
He did it!

01:15:11.100 --> 01:15:13.150
lnuyasha! You're great!

01:15:13.570 --> 01:15:14.710
He's not bad.

01:15:15.240 --> 01:15:17.480
But there's still one mark left.

01:15:18.140 --> 01:15:18.890
Huh?

01:15:19.110 --> 01:15:20.150
What does that mean?

01:15:22.480 --> 01:15:23.860
Are you all right, lnuyasha?

01:15:24.080 --> 01:15:25.630
Quit worrying about me!

01:15:45.000 --> 01:15:47.580
So finally, the true form appears.

01:15:48.140 --> 01:15:49.020
Kagome!

01:15:49.410 --> 01:15:50.080
What is it?

01:15:50.510 --> 01:15:52.590
Don't just stand there!
Let's go!

01:15:52.980 --> 01:15:55.160
l don't have
my bow and arrows!

01:15:56.780 --> 01:15:58.790
Well, do something about it!

01:15:59.020 --> 01:16:00.660
But. . .

01:16:02.590 --> 01:16:04.160
l can turn into a bow. . .

01:16:04.190 --> 01:16:05.870
but l can't transform
into an arrow.

01:16:06.790 --> 01:16:08.800
Boy, he looks dangerous.

01:16:09.330 --> 01:16:11.940
You think lnuyasha can handle him?

01:16:12.530 --> 01:16:16.680
Hey, is there anything l can
use for an arrow?

01:16:17.100 --> 01:16:19.280
Like a piece of wood
that's thin and straight. . .

01:16:19.300 --> 01:16:21.050
and a sharp rock?

01:16:21.070 --> 01:16:21.850
Exactly!

01:16:26.880 --> 01:16:28.050
Mother?

01:17:02.810 --> 01:17:04.790
Shion. . .

01:17:05.020 --> 01:17:06.430
Go for it, Shion.

01:17:07.080 --> 01:17:08.460
We're right by you.

01:17:26.870 --> 01:17:27.880
Kirara!

01:17:35.880 --> 01:17:38.760
The game's just beginning.

01:17:40.180 --> 01:17:41.330
Dammit!

01:17:43.720 --> 01:17:45.000
Kagome!

01:17:49.960 --> 01:17:59.280
Shion!

01:17:59.670 --> 01:18:00.610
Asagi!

01:18:07.550 --> 01:18:08.490
lnuyasha!

01:18:20.260 --> 01:18:21.070
Sister. . .

01:18:22.290 --> 01:18:23.300
Take my hand.

01:18:23.490 --> 01:18:24.540
Let's go!

01:18:26.560 --> 01:18:27.270
Right!

01:18:45.650 --> 01:18:46.830
Wind Tunnel!

01:18:52.190 --> 01:18:52.900
Miroku!

01:18:53.220 --> 01:18:54.200
Hiraikotsu!

01:18:58.960 --> 01:19:00.510
You bastard!

01:19:04.030 --> 01:19:05.580
Kagome!

01:19:07.440 --> 01:19:08.380
Shippo!

01:19:11.210 --> 01:19:12.350
ls everyone all right?

01:19:12.610 --> 01:19:13.920
Kagome!

01:19:15.380 --> 01:19:15.990
Look!

01:19:16.780 --> 01:19:18.760
Where did you get these?

01:19:19.050 --> 01:19:20.930
The fireflies told us.

01:19:22.020 --> 01:19:23.130
Fireflies?

01:19:33.930 --> 01:19:34.670
lnuyasha!

01:19:48.610 --> 01:19:50.960
l gave you some credit. . .

01:19:51.650 --> 01:19:54.830
but you're nothing, after all.

01:19:55.950 --> 01:19:56.800
Huh?!

01:19:58.490 --> 01:19:59.500
W-What?!

01:20:25.950 --> 01:20:26.930
Please. . .

01:20:27.280 --> 01:20:28.800
lnuyasha. . .!

01:20:36.030 --> 01:20:36.840
lnuyasha!

01:20:37.700 --> 01:20:38.770
Awright!

01:20:38.800 --> 01:20:41.610
l feel like fighting!

01:20:44.900 --> 01:20:46.110
Let's go, Kagome!

01:20:47.300 --> 01:20:48.750
Playtime's over!

01:20:49.670 --> 01:20:50.820
Die!

01:20:58.020 --> 01:20:59.990
Adamant. . .

01:21:00.020 --> 01:21:01.590
Go!

01:21:01.820 --> 01:21:03.760
Backlash Wave!

01:21:23.110 --> 01:21:24.950
Hah! We did it!

01:21:26.580 --> 01:21:27.650
The scar is gone!

01:21:28.280 --> 01:21:29.160
You're right!

01:21:31.650 --> 01:21:33.130
We're saved!

01:21:33.150 --> 01:21:33.760
Uh-huh!

01:21:36.190 --> 01:21:36.900
Ai. . .

01:21:37.490 --> 01:21:38.530
Thank you!

01:21:58.710 --> 01:21:59.990
Horai lsland is. . .

01:22:00.580 --> 01:22:01.920
disappearing.

01:22:09.790 --> 01:22:13.500
The Cauldron of Resonance
lost its power. . .

01:22:13.660 --> 01:22:16.170
so the time barrier
collapsed.

01:22:16.790 --> 01:22:18.500
When you think about it,

01:22:18.530 --> 01:22:21.440
this was probably the fate
of this island all along.

01:22:24.340 --> 01:22:27.250
Good-bye, Mother.

01:22:34.350 --> 01:22:36.720
Let's go, everyone!

01:22:37.080 --> 01:22:38.490
- Right!
- Right!

01:26:16.130 --> 01:26:18.410
Lord Sesshomaru, where have you been?

01:26:19.500 --> 01:26:21.810
Please tell me, Lord Sesshomaru!

01:26:21.910 --> 01:26:23.180
Now, now, Rin.

01:26:23.210 --> 01:26:26.120
Don't be asking Lord Sesshomaru
unnecessary questions.

01:26:26.210 --> 01:26:29.890
But l want to know all
about Lord Sesshomaru!

01:26:30.480 --> 01:26:32.960
Wait, Lord Sesshomaru!

01:26:35.990 --> 01:26:38.630
l hope you kids are prepared.

01:26:39.220 --> 01:26:39.870
Huh?

01:26:40.460 --> 01:26:42.500
lt's the age of wars
in the outside world.

01:26:42.690 --> 01:26:46.070
There are tons of demons who prey
on half-demons.

01:26:46.200 --> 01:26:48.710
Don't worry, lnuyasha.

01:26:49.030 --> 01:26:50.810
We'll be okay.

01:26:51.070 --> 01:26:53.550
We can survive.

01:26:53.740 --> 01:26:56.880
lf you can do it, lnuyasha,
there's no reason why we can't.

01:26:57.910 --> 01:27:01.390
Be careful that you don't get
warped like lnuyasha.

01:27:01.750 --> 01:27:03.820
She's right!
lt's such a pain.

01:27:04.050 --> 01:27:07.160
We'll manage, l'm sure.

01:27:07.550 --> 01:27:10.400
We'll do our best
just like lnuyasha.

01:27:10.620 --> 01:27:12.630
These kids will be fine.

01:27:12.890 --> 01:27:16.300
After all, they defied
the Four War Gods.

01:27:16.590 --> 01:27:18.400
No need to tell me that!

01:27:19.360 --> 01:27:20.440
lnuyasha. . .

01:27:20.730 --> 01:27:21.470
Huh?

01:27:21.730 --> 01:27:23.180
Really. . .thank you so much.

01:27:23.200 --> 01:27:26.410
We'll never forget you.

01:27:29.070 --> 01:27:30.520
Y-Yeah. . .

01:27:30.710 --> 01:27:31.850
You're embarrassed!

01:27:32.910 --> 01:27:34.390
Good-bye!

01:27:34.440 --> 01:27:35.720
Thank you!

01:27:37.950 --> 01:27:40.790
Well then, lnuyasha,
shall we be on our way too?

01:27:40.920 --> 01:27:42.030
Yeah.

01:27:48.960 --> 01:27:55.910
THE END
